\&\fBvirt\-filesystems\fR\|(1),
\&\fBvirt\-make\-fs\fR\|(1),
\&\fBvirt\-rescue\fR\|(1),
\&\fBvirt\-resize\fR\|(1),
http://libguestfs.org/.
